    "rich_text_gHwTL6": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading_8zEBGi": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How we protect your information",
            "heading_size": "h3",
            "remove_space": false,
            "remove_letter_spacing": true
          }
        },
        "text_TwN8zW": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Protection of your personal data is in accordance with the Czech Republic‘s Law on the Protection of Personal Data ch no. 101/2000 Coll.<br/>subsequent amendments and regulations.</p><p>Encryption of your sensitive data transfer is made with 256-bit GeoTrust® SSL certificate.</p><p>Our company does not store any credit card details.<br/>All payment details are exclusively stored on the secure server of our payment service provider, HPC Heidelberger Payment Consulting GmbH.</p><p>ARTĚL‘s online store is operated by ARTĚL Glass, LLC, headquartered at Vinohradská 164, 130 00 Prague 3, Czech Republic,<br/>File Reference A 40479 registered in the Commercial Register maintained by the Municipal Court in Prague, Czech Republic.</p>",
            "description_size": "",
            "description_font": "body_font",
            "remove_space": false
          }
        },
